      "id": "vsdljbc",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Meaning of Chemical Reaction"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Chemical reactions represent processes where reactants transform into chemically distinct products.",
        "A balanced chemical equation strictly adheres to the Law of Conservation of Mass.",
        "Indicators such as color change, gas evolution, and temperature variation confirm a chemical reaction.",
        "Oxidation involves the gain of oxygen or loss of electrons, whereas reduction involves the loss of oxygen or gain of electrons.",
        "Corrosion and rancidity are natural degradation processes driven by oxidation reactions."
      ],
      "id": "74h88h0"
    },
